0 gears-compound-8-24-8-40 (Brickwright Robot Lab validation machine)
0 Name: gears-compound-8-24-8-40.ldr
0 Author: Brickwright
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Compound gear train 8:24 then 8:40 (Robot Lab validation, test/bw-sim-validation.test.mjs).
0 // Bench: a SPIKE medium motor (port A) stands output-up at the origin (LDraw, -y up); a beam lies under
0 // its housing, pinned into the housing's bottom holes u0/u1 (x = +-20) by two friction pins, so beam and
0 // housing are one rigid frame. The motor's output carries a 3L axle (y -90..-30). Driven gears ride 8L axles
0 // that turn in the frame beam's round holes and pass the housing's side (x >= 34). Pitch radii (module 1,
0 // 1 mm = 2.5 LDU): 8T 10, 24T 30, 40T 50 LDU, so meshing centres are hole multiples of 20 LDU.
0 // Input 8T on the motor at y -60; 24T at x = 40 (centres 10 + 30 = 40); a second 8T on the 24T's axle at
0 // y -80 (one gear width higher) drives a 40T at x = 100 (10 + 50 = 60), on an 8L axle in the end hole of
0 // the beam 11 frame. Output/input = (-8/24) * (-8/40) = +1/15.
0 !BW ID motor
0 !BW PORT A
1 71 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 54696p01.dat
0 !BW ID frame
1 72 0 40 0 0 0 1 0 1 0 -1 0 0 32525.dat
0 !BW ID framePin1
1 0 20 30 0 0 1 0 1 0 0 0 0 -1 2780.dat
0 !BW ID framePin2
1 0 -20 30 0 0 1 0 1 0 0 0 0 -1 2780.dat
0 !BW ID axleIn
1 4 0 -60 0 0 1 0 1 0 0 0 0 -1 4519.dat
0 !BW ID gIn
1 16 0 -60 0 1 0 0 0 0 1 0 -1 0 3647.dat
0 !BW ID axleMid
1 4 40 -10 0 0 1 0 1 0 0 0 0 -1 3707.dat
0 !BW ID gMid24
1 16 40 -60 0 1 0 0 0 0 1 0 -1 0 3648.dat
0 !BW ID gMid8
1 16 40 -80 0 1 0 0 0 0 1 0 -1 0 3647.dat
0 !BW ID axleOut
1 4 100 -30 0 0 1 0 1 0 0 0 0 -1 3707.dat
0 !BW ID gOut
1 16 100 -80 0 1 0 0 0 0 1 0 -1 0 3649.dat
